<title>BELGIUM: EU oilseeds lobby sees lower production in 1996.</title>
<headline>EU oilseeds lobby sees lower production in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>COCERAL, the European oilseeds umbrella group, forecast on Monday a three percent reduction in production this year compared with 1995.</p>
<p>It said oilseeds production this year would be 12.26 million tonnes compared with 12.61 million in 1995.  </p>
<p>The EU rapeseed crop was forecast to fall 12 percent to 7.27 million tonnes from 8.29 million while the sunflower seed crop was forecast up 17 percent at 4.01 million tonnes from 3.41 million.</p>
<p>Soybean production was forecast up eight percent at 983,000 tonnes after 906,000 tonnes in 1995.</p>
<p>-Brussels newsroom +32 2 287-6830</p>
